 "Add .js file": "新增 .js 檔案",
 "Add Kubai Icons to my slides or document. It may be something new or an existing file that needs polish. Use your judgment on where icons help; not every page needs one. Keep one style and size throughout.\n\nIcon list: {site}/data/index.json\nDownload an SVG: {site}/api/icon/<name>.svg?color=<six-digit hex without #>, adding &variant=soft for a softer look\nMatch the file's main color where you can. If the tool can't use SVG, convert to a PNG with a transparent background.": "請用 Kubai Icons 為我的簡報或文件加上圖示。可以是新製作的內容，也可以是修飾現有檔案。哪些地方適合加圖示由你判斷，不必每頁都有，整份檔案的風格和大小保持一致。\n\n圖示清單：{site}/data/index.json\n下載 SVG：{site}/api/icon/<name>.svg?color=<不含 # 的六位數色碼>，想要柔和一點可加上 &variant=soft\n顏色盡量取自檔案的主色。若工具不支援 SVG，請轉成透明背景的 PNG。",
 "Add Kubai Icons to this project:\n1. Install the package for its framework: kubai-icons-react for React or Next.js, kubai-icons-vue for Vue or Nuxt, kubai-icons for anything else.\n2. Find icons by name and tags in {site}/data/index.json. Usage is at {site}/docs/.\n3. Replace the icons in the navigation and main actions with Kubai Icons of the same meaning. Keep their sizes and colors, and change no other code.\n4. Run the project's build, then tell me which icons changed. List any with no good match instead of forcing one.": "請將 Kubai Icons 加入這個專案：\n1. 依專案使用的框架安裝對應的套件：React 或 Next.js 使用 kubai-icons-react，Vue 或 Nuxt 使用 kubai-icons-vue，其他情況使用 kubai-icons。\n2. 在 {site}/data/index.json 中依名稱和標籤尋找圖示，用法請見 {site}/docs/。\n3. 將導覽列和主要操作中的圖示，換成意義相同的 Kubai Icons，保留原有的尺寸和顏色，不要更動其他程式碼。\n4. 執行專案的建置，然後告訴我換了哪些圖示。沒有合適對應的圖示請列出來，不要勉強替換。",
