 "Submit an icon": "提交圖示",
 "Submit an icon you drew with the Kubai Icons skill or by hand. Accepted icons join the open-source library with credit to you.": "提交你用 Kubai Icons Skill 或手繪的圖示。通過審核的圖示會收錄到開源圖示庫，並標示你的署名。",
 "Submit my icon to the Kubai Icons library:\n1. Export it as an SVG by running node scripts/export.mjs --only <name> in the skill folder.\n2. Ask me to confirm that I made it, that it contains no logos or copied artwork, and that I agree to publish it under the MIT License. Stop if I do not confirm.\n3. Run gh issue create --repo kubai087/kubai-icons --title \"[Icon submission] <name>\" with a body using these headings: \"### Name\" (kebab-case), \"### What it does on hover\" and \"### Files\" (the SVG in a code block, plus the icon's .js source if there is one).\n4. Tell me the issue link.": "請將我繪製的圖示提交到 Kubai Icons 圖示庫：\n1. 在 Skill 資料夾中執行 node scripts/export.mjs --only <name>，匯出 SVG。\n2. 請我確認：圖示由我繪製，不含標誌或抄襲的內容，並同意以 MIT 授權發布。若我未確認，請停止。\n3. 執行 gh issue create --repo kubai087/kubai-icons --title \"[Icon submission] <name>\"，內文使用這些標題：\"### Name\"（以連字號連接的小寫英文）、\"### What it does on hover\"、\"### Files\"（以程式碼區塊放入 SVG，若有 .js 原始檔也一併放入）。\n4. 告訴我 Issue 的連結。",
 "Support the development of Kubai Icons, a free and open-source icon library, with Alipay or WeChat Pay.": "以支付寶或微信支付，支持免費開源圖示庫 Kubai Icons 的開發。",
